{"suttaId":"an4.231","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-iv","vriCode":"s0402m3.mul","paras":[1750,1754],"vripara":"231"},"segments":{"an4.231:0.3":"Kavisuttaṃ","an4.231:1.1":"“Cattārome, bhikkhave, kavī.","an4.231:1.2":"Katame cattāro?","an4.231:1.3":"Cintākavi, sutakavi, atthakavi, paṭibhānakavi –","an4.231:1.4":"ime kho, bhikkhave, cattāro kavī”ti.","an4.231:1.5":"Ekādasamaṃ.","an4.231:1.6":"Duccaritavaggo tatiyo.","an4.231:2.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","an4.231:2.1":"Duccaritaṃ diṭṭhi akataññū ca,","an4.231:2.2":"pāṇātipātāpi dve maggā;","an4.231:2.3":"Dve vohārapathā vuttā,","an4.231:2.4":"ahirikaṃ duppaññakavinā cāti."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Mp-iv","bookName":"Catukkanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0402a.att","from":1672,"to":1675,"paras":[{"para":1672,"vripara":"221-231","refs":["an4.231:1"],"lines":["221-231. Tatiyassa paṭhamādīni uttānatthāneva.","Dasame yo cintetvā kabyaṃ karoti, ayaṃ <b>cintākavi</b> nāma.","Yo sutvā karoti, ayaṃ <b>sutakavi</b> nāma.","Yo ekaṃ atthaṃ nissāya karoti, ayaṃ <b>atthakavi</b> nāma.","Yo taṅkhaṇaññeva vaṅgīsatthero viya attano paṭibhānena karoti, ayaṃ <b>paṭibhānakavi</b> nāmāti."],"lineRefs":[["an4.231:1"],["an4.231:1"],["an4.231:1"],["an4.231:1"],["an4.231:1"]]},{"para":1673,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.231:1"],"lines":["Duccaritavaggo tatiyo."],"lineRefs":[["an4.231:1"]]},{"para":1674,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.231:1"],"lines":["(24)4. Kammavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["an4.231:1"]]},{"para":1675,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.231:1"],"lines":["Saṃkhittasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an4.231:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-iv","bookName":"Catukkanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0402t.tik","from":1870,"to":1873,"paras":[{"para":1870,"vripara":"221-231","refs":["an4.231:1"],"lines":["221-231. Tatiyassa paṭhamādīni uttānatthāneva.","<b>Cintākavī</b>tiādīsu vatthuanusandhiubhayameva cirena cintetvā karaṇavasena <b>cintākavi</b> veditabbo.","Kiñci sutvā sutena assutaṃ anusandhetvā karaṇavasena <b>sutakavi,</b> kiñci atthaṃ upadhāretvā tassa saṅkhipanavitthāraṇādivasena <b>atthakavi</b> yaṃkiñci parena kataṃ kabbaṃ nāṭakaṃ vā disvā taṃsadisameva aññaṃ attano ṭhānuppattikappaṭibhānena karaṇavasena <b>paṭibhānakavi</b> veditabbo."],"lineRefs":[["an4.231:1"],["an4.231:1"],["an4.231:1"]]},{"para":1871,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.231:1"],"lines":["Duccaritavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an4.231:1"]]},{"para":1872,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.231:1"],"lines":["(24)4. Kammavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["an4.231:1"]]},{"para":1873,"vripara":null,"refs":["an4.231:1"],"lines":["Saṃkhittasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an4.231:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
